# NOTICE — adapted procedures

This skill carries three procedures adapted from upstream projects: the
pre-mortem, the brainstorming (design-shaping) core and the consensus-plan
recipe. Each is rewritten in jstack's terms and is not a vendored copy.

## Pre-mortem procedure

This procedure is adapted from `tjboudreaux/cc-thinking-skills`, pinned at
commit `7b8fece345dfaa11773be7152ccd194589cb5437`. The source is the
[upstream pre-mortem skill](https://github.com/tjboudreaux/cc-thinking-skills/blob/7b8fece345dfaa11773be7152ccd194589cb5437/skills/thinking-pre-mortem/SKILL.md).

The procedure has been rewritten in jstack's terms for Phase 2, its version 2
contract, and plan-body ownership. Its effectiveness has not been measured:
upstream unmeasured; jstack unmeasured.

